[box=Play more?]"Play more" has become a gag when answering questions of the like of "how to improve?".
Play more [u]on it's own[/u] does not work. I am the living proof of that.
If anything, you could try to "Play more [i]and play smarter[/i]".

Also please remember that:
Playtime ≠ Skill
Playtime = [i]Experience[/i]

Playing more [i]does[/i] help, but there's many other factors involved and many other things you can do to improve, too.

tl;dr You do not need a certain amount of playtime to "play well" and having a large amount of playtime racked up doesn't imply you'll necessarily "play well" either.

